* MINT-ERRORS: 27 10 46 46 46 46
* Ref: ../dbase3-decomp/specs/commands/set-commands.md:236
* Extended 2026-11-01 (initech-2e6lp, lane set-memowidth): after the original
* probes, real-III+ cases for the rule's range, truncation, low-byte wrap,
* word-split, ? / mixed-column / two-memo-column layout and the reset form.
? "[W2-BEGIN]"
USE MEMO
? "[DEFAULT MEMOWIDTH]"
LIST NOTE
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 20
? "[MEMOWIDTH TWENTY]"
LIST NOTE
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 50
? "[MEMOWIDTH FIFTY]"
LIST NOTE
? "[BAD NUMERIC OPERAND]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO "BAD"
? "[MISSING TO]"
SET MEMOWIDTH 20
? "[ZERO MEMOWIDTH]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 0
? "[LOW EDGE SEVEN]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 7
? "[NEGATIVE]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO -5
? "[SEVEN POINT NINE]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 7.9
? "[EIGHT POINT FOUR]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 8.4
GO TOP
LIST OFF NOTE
? "[WIDTH 12]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 12
GO TOP
LIST NOTE
? "[WIDTH 9.9]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 9.9
GO TOP
LIST OFF NOTE
? "[EXPRESSION 3*5]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 3*5
GO TOP
LIST OFF NOTE
? "[WIDTH 263 = 7 SPLITS WORD]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 263
GO TOP
LIST OFF NOTE
? "[WIDTH 300 = 44]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 300
GO TOP
LIST OFF NOTE
? "[WIDTH 255]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 255
GO TOP
LIST OFF NOTE
? "[WIDTH 256 = 0]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 256
GO TOP
LIST NOTE
? "[WIDTH 16 MIXED COLUMNS]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 16
GO TOP
LIST RECNO(), NOTE, RECNO()*2
? "[TWO MEMO COLUMNS]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 10
GO TOP
LIST NOTE, NOTE
? "[QUESTION AT 8]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO 8
GO TOP
? NOTE
? "[RESET]"
SET MEMOWIDTH TO
GO TOP
LIST NOTE
? "[W2-END]"
RETURN
